{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_8_level_spst_08-04","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"spst_08-04","title":"燃烧的片段4","storyCode":"EG-4","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_spst_08-04.txt","sourceHash":"819699d0e8876fd1ea69e46c5f6a4bf201fecfaf4e3b91604b99fe0e766064b2","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"关于信任的事。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_topout"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，情况怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"不太好。虽然留在下层的只有几个魔族佬......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"但他们都是身经百战的雇佣兵，讨厌得很，哪怕他们只有一颗螺丝钉，都能想出一百种厮杀的手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"论作战能力，我们半斤八两，可论人数，我们只有他们的一半。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，有没有但是？我的腿已经快没知觉了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"有，“但是”雇佣兵内部的队伍发生了分歧。至少外面有一部分是，眼下在我们楼底下的那群，不太清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"这根本不算好消息，啊，痛......刚才那个家伙下手真狠啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"做了应急处理就知足吧，想点别的事情，分散注意力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......上面越来越热了。从刚才开始，上面的动静都大得有点恐怖......而且，就，怎么说呢，有点喘不过气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"让你分散注意力，没让你去想这些事情！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿米娅，阿米娅她没关系吧？还有那个龙门的警官，啊，虽然我只见过她一面......但一想到她们在对付......对付......呃，啥呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，你都开始说胡话了，看来血流得的确不少——慢着，有通讯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急促的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是我，我现在快抵达地面了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么情况？敌人呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急促的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"走大运了。刚才塔顶爆发出的法术像是火山爆发一样吞没了我们驻守的楼层，我们趁乱解决了几个放哨的，剩下的只能选择往下层的空地撤离——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为他们会死守这里......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急促的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也许大家都有种预感，都清楚上面发生的事情正在超乎“战术”范畴的预想——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"等......发生什么了！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"唔啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"抓紧我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"不对......火，火蔓延开了！？这里有什么可燃物吗！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"高温......和情报说的一样，这是塔露拉的伎俩......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"别傻站着了！现在该怎么办！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——走这边，和其他人汇合！等等，你的腿没事了！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"分散注意力！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_topout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急促的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"确认全部通讯，暂时没有伤亡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"别着急，那些雇佣兵可没走远，他们在确认事态，寻找机会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"现在这座指挥塔因为塔顶突如其来的爆炸而陷入......短暂的平静。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急促的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"你把这情形叫做平静！？阿、阿米娅她们没事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......就因为塔顶是这个情形，我才觉得我们这里很安静。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"总、总算——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"不要放松警惕，我们还——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎么突然不说话了？喂——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你看天上做什么？塔顶有什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等，那、那是一个......光球？一团......一团火？光晕？那是啥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"法术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......法术？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急促的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！我做了记录，从第一声巨响开始，火焰和高温气流就冲垮了建筑的穹顶，从塔的下方肉眼观测，像是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"像是落日的余晖。\n像是前仆后继的感染者之死。\n像是愤怒。\n像是这座将毁的城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......我自以为比起你们不算个特别感性的人，但我大概知道你要说什么，真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是属于整合运动领袖的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"高温和火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"但高温和火......不该是这么可怕的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，那团光，那是一个人......两个人，不，也许是更多、更多的愤怒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"那个就是......塔露拉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，或者说，不止，远远不止。情报里的那个整合运动领袖谁都知道，我实在无法把我现在看见的东西和那个年轻的龙联系起来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急促的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"上面......上面到底发生了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"......不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急促的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"指挥塔里还有其他人吗！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急促的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我们得去帮他们！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！低头！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"——有敌人离开了指挥塔！去找他们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"封锁这里，不要让他们有寻援的机会。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急促的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"现、现在怎么办！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"也许我们该回去帮阿米娅——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"——不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"只有阿米娅......只有阿米娅能做到。她能的。一定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信她。我也只因为这个理由，才站在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"而且她还答应过我，在带薪休假的时候陪我逛街......当领袖的可不能食言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"那么在阿米娅凯旋之前，我们决不能放弃指挥塔。至少，撑到凯尔希医生抵达。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"我们——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——喂，有什么东西切开了天上的，呃，那玩意！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"——你们听见了吗！？又是一次！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......是剑？对了，那个龙门警官的确是用剑的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急促的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这是一把剑能发出的动静？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"......我去拦住指挥塔外的雇佣兵。你们回到塔里，接应剩下的人，确保一条没被摧毁的撤离道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你一个人怎么拦那么多萨卡兹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"我也陪她去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"你们立刻回去，快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......罗德岛的人数不多，通知其他小队收网。我们往这边......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"尽快搅碎防线，他们的死会是我们最好的筹码。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急促的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"你们俩不要勉强自己，他们人数很多！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"......很久没这样，我们两个并肩作战，找机会伏击敌人了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"两位身经百战的干员默契地握紧了武器，萨卡兹厚重的威胁正在向前推进。\n双方目不转睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......的确。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"那么休假的事，你俩缺不缺个拎包的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
